{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LabyTrip Spirit</strong> is a game of adventures and tribulations endured by a soul that missed the Day of Judgment and has no desire to await the next. To attain an eternal abode, you must make your way through the secret passages of the Tower of Babel or the subterranean labyrinths of the netherworld, gathering ancient artifacts. You will not walk the path to eternal repose in perpetual solitude; you will have to form alliances and confront other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOVE THE LABYRINTH'S CORRIDORS.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030890/extras/b08fdee2361fba4cddf45689b0ebbd3b.poster.avif?t=1772008261\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030890/extras/b08fdee2361fba4cddf45689b0ebbd3b.webm?t=1772008261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030890/extras/b08fdee2361fba4cddf45689b0ebbd3b.mp4?t=1772008261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The labyrinths are ever-shifting - guided by your command, the schemes of allies and adversaries, or the cryptic designs of destiny itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT ANCIENT ARTIFACTS.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030890/extras/db82d66e69a35e972cfa4b869c5d1139.poster.avif?t=1772008261\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030890/extras/db82d66e69a35e972cfa4b869c5d1139.webm?t=1772008261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030890/extras/db82d66e69a35e972cfa4b869c5d1139.mp4?t=1772008261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To advance to the next level, you must collect a set of sacred objects scattered throughout the locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WATCH OUT FOR TRAPS.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030890/extras/0da8fb3d8ce51e9d8d12b71e34af3645.poster.avif?t=1772008261\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030890/extras/0da8fb3d8ce51e9d8d12b71e34af3645.webm?t=1772008261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030890/extras/0da8fb3d8ce51e9d8d12b71e34af3645.mp4?t=1772008261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey will be no easy stroll. Stay vigilant of your surroundings, for any object may conceal peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIND ARTIFACTS TO UNLOCK UNIQUE POWERS.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030890/extras/2dbd47b247c0d778efa0c49bf12c34e3.poster.avif?t=1772008261\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030890/extras/2dbd47b247c0d778efa0c49bf12c34e3.webm?t=1772008261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030890/extras/2dbd47b247c0d778efa0c49bf12c34e3.mp4?t=1772008261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient magic will help you navigate the endless corridors faster and safer, but the supply of powerful artifacts is limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are constrained by their own abilities and stop at what they've achieved (single-player game).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others are willing to step over others and, through competitive struggle, go further than peaceful wanderers (competitive game).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who travel the farthest are the ones capable of working in a team with friends or random companions (team-based game).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4030890?t=1772008261","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030890/85c44d7819c54820bf80a00adf235eced71b608c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772008261","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030890/eda899533d33408a4fa6cc590e894ef8f141404e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772008261","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030890/eda899533d33408a4fa6cc590e894ef8f141404e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772008261","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><